\ Fixture for aot_module_word_identity. Exports `probe` under the same name as
\ the sibling B fixture, plus `a-probe`, whose body calls this module's own
\ `probe` directly. Both bodies are plain and compilable, so freeze discovers
\ and compiles them, and `a-probe`'s call site must reach this module's `probe`
\ rather than B's.

probe: ( -- str ) [ "A-PROBE" ] ;

a-probe: ( -- str ) [ probe ] ;
